:: Haunted House(1) {"position":"900,600","size":"100,100"}
The main room of the house has to large stair cases climbing on either side of a large statue in the middle of the room. It was dark and ominous as you began to walk, the light dimmed and the house seemed to til. You triped on a loose floor board and got back up.

<span id="more-button">
    <<button "Talk">>
        <<replace "#more-button">>
            <<print $playerName>>: "Hey $characterName, is it just me or does the house seem... alive?"
            
            <<print $characterName>>: "No you're so right, its giving me the chilles and I don't like it one bit!"
        <</replace>>
    <</button>>
</span>

[[Unconcous Room(2)]] South
Can't go back outside.

