:: Outside The Haunted House {"position":"900,200","size":"100,100"}
The night was cold and creepy, after all is was Halloween of 1998 and you and some of the neigborhood kids decided to go out late at night and do neigborhood kid stuff. At the end of your street, where the rotting house that Old Man Jeff died in last Spring was, you all decided to meet there earlier that afternoon and have a dare-off...

"I dare you _____ to go to that haunted house at the end of the street and go inside for 10 minutes scardy cat!" - neighborhood boy

<<textbox "$playerName" "">>

Enter your name and press Enter.

<span id="more-button">
    <<button "Respond">>
        <<replace "#more-button">>
            "Am not! And I'll take your bet!" - you
            
            "Ok then I'm going with them!" - your best friend
            
            Name your best friend

			<<textbox "$characterName" "">>
            <span id="more-button">
    			<<button "Do Dare">>
        			<<replace "#more-button">>
            			[[Haunted House(1)]] South
        			<</replace>>
    			<</button>>
			</span>
        <</replace>>
    <</button>>
</span>


